 #: system/settings/settings.xml
-#. Setting value: the depth of HDR is the driver's choice, the default (core #39875)
+#. Setting value: the depth of HDR is the driver's choice, the default; also the "Automatic" of the 3D MVC, 3D output, HDR10 adapted to the display, Dolby Vision drawing path and fidelity step-down settings (core #39875)
 msgctxt "#32116"
